          "prompt": "From: Buddy Williams <buddy.williams@insurity.com>\nSubject: SignalReader fails a whole round when goal-agent writes malformed JSON to signal.json\n\nBody:\nSignalReader fails a whole round when goal-agent writes malformed JSON to signal.json\r\n\r\n  Summary\r\n\r\n  When the goal-agent (Claude Code) writes <process_id>.signal.json at the end of a phase, refine's SignalReader waits 2000 ms for the file to become valid JSON. If parsing\r\n  still fails after the grace period, refine hard-fails the round with Workflow failed: Goal Agent completion signal �K remained invalid JSON. The round is dropped to\r\n  state=failed, phase=plan|implement, no source is touched, and no retry is attempted. Multiple unrelated goals are being burned this way �X the round agent worked fine, but\r\n  its terminal JSON payload had a structural mistake and there is no recovery path.\r\n\r\n  Blast radius (this box only, run/8082/)\r\n\r\n  - 7 distinct goal-agent sessions failed with this exact error pattern (grep signal.json remained invalid JSON in run/*/operations/*.json �� 7 hits).\r\n  - At least 3 distinct goals affected across recent runs:\r\n    - 00000SZWPPF3NJVZT6427CG00T �X \"PL LOB > Recent Claims > Claim Maintenance > Dates/Events > Select 'Accepted?'\"\r\n    - 00000SZW375SPJW874J5V7W005\r\n    - 00000SZW3ZX1PGY7E4TDV7W009\r\n  - Fails in both implementation_phase=plan (most common) and implement.\r\n\r\n  Failure signatures observed (all after 2000 ms)\r\n\r\n  �z�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�s�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�s�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�{\r\n  �x Column position �x                             Error                              �x       Session        �x\r\n  �u�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�t\r\n  �x line 1 col 2278 �x EOF while parsing an object                                    �x de381e6e             �x\r\n  �u�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�t\r\n  �x line 1 col 2296 �x EOF while parsing an object                                    �x db20f007             �x\r\n  �u�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�t\r\n  �x line 1 col 2449 �x EOF while parsing an object                                    �x 7648d691             �x\r\n  �u�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�t\r\n  �x line 1 col 2734 �x EOF while parsing an object                                    �x 137926a4 (this goal) �x\r\n  �u�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�t\r\n  �x line 1 col 2858 �x expected `,` or `}`                                            �x b6b61930             �x\r\n  �u�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�t\r\n  �x line 1 col 2932 �x EOF while parsing an object                                    �x 1543bdb8             �x\r\n  �u�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�q�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�w�